  "authored_surface": "Two broad Ionic shafts, three dark vertical window stacks, two individual side balconies with metal guards, three bronze entrance portals, three recessed top-floor centre openings, two narrow flanking upper windows and toothed top coping. Dimensions and rear elevations are estimated from exterior records. The gazetteer also identifies warrior and bodhisattva sculptures whose individual faces remain undocumented in the model."
